WEBVTT

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:08.600
<i>You know the continuation of the fairy tale
I've wanted to hear about?</i>

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:16.770
<i>If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand</i>

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:26.750
<i>It's like we were both seeking
a coincidence that was off by a page</i>

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:28.920
<i>And that's how fate
brought us together</i>

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:37.090
<i>More than those words
that you once kept to yourself</i>

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:46.000
<i>It's the kindness that made you
keep them to yourself</i>

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:53.010
<i>That I want to have
faith in now</i>

00:01:53.010 --> 00:02:00.650
<i>You know, we'll be living alongside
uncertainty from now on</i>

00:02:00.650 --> 00:02:07.060
<i>We used to have nothing to lose,
but that's not us now</i>

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:14.760
<i>You know the continuation of the fairy tale
I didn't know about before?</i>

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:21.000
<i>If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand</i>

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.840
<i>It's something to build up
bit by bit</i>

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:35.450
<i>"The City of Auroras"</i>

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:41.850
<i>Dale Boyd.</i>

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:47.560
<i>24 counts of theft. 11 counts of battery.
6 counts of sexual assault.</i>

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:51.300
<i>There's a bounty on your head.</i>

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.930
<i>Is this any way
for a hunter to behave?</i>

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:55.870
<i>I may be your target,</i>

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:57.630
<i>but shooting a nonresistant
person will result...</i>

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:04.540
<i>...in your license being revoked.</i>

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:07.480
<i>Sorry. This is my way
of doing things.</i>

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:19.980
<i>Hold it!</i>

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:23.160
<i>We've finally caught up with her.</i>

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:26.030
<i>So, who the heck is she anyway?</i>

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:28.570
<i>Don't let your guard down, you two.</i>

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:31.400
<i>She's an intruder, who got into
the top secret sector.</i>

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:33.940
<i>Take her into custody immediately.</i>

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:34.940
<i>Roger.</i>

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.840
<i>- Let's go.
- Sure thing.</i>

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:41.510
<i>Silvia, please make sure you pull
your punches so you don't kill her.</i>

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:42.840
<i>I know.</i>

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:00.390
<i>Hey! What the hell
is the deal with you?!</i>

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:19.250
<i>I'm sorry.
She got away.</i>

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:20.090
<i>Accela!</i>

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:21.420
<i>It's no use.</i>

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.720
<i>The Aurora-Wave
interference is too strong</i>

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:25.890
<i>and the sensors aren't working.</i>

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:28.060
<i>We've lost the target.</i>

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:31.630
<i>You bastard! My partner's
not going to stand for this!</i>

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:37.570
<i>Scum like you always
make the same kinds of threats.</i>

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:41.040
<i>A-All right, I give up.
I've lost.</i>

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:42.910
<i>Here.
I surrender.</i>

00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:59.690
What?!

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:00.760
<i>That's impossible!</i>

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:02.700
<i>Where the hell...</i>

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:04.800
<i>A resemble, huh?</i>

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:09.940
<i>You punks all use resemble
technology in the same ways.</i>

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:12.070
<i>H-Hold on, don't shoot.</i>

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:17.040
<i>I'm just a small-time thief,
who lost his left arm in Blast Fall.</i>

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:20.280
<i>It's not like the bounty on my head
is that hefty, right?</i>

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.050
Blast Fall?

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:25.080
<i>Let's make a deal.
I'll pay you double the bounty.</i>

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:28.350
<i>So let me...</i>

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:30.460
<i>Why are you alive?</i>

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:33.490
<i>Why is a scummy punk
like you alive?!</i>

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:34.480
<i>Hey...</i>

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:39.660
<i>Wait a minute...</i>

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:50.480
<i>Good morning.
This is your morning news.</i>

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:53.810
<i>Yesterday, the RUC's Government
Division held a panel</i>

00:05:53.810 --> 00:05:57.850
<i>concerning possible revisions
to the law on altitude limitations.</i>

00:05:57.850 --> 00:06:01.350
<i>During the panel, it was reported
that the magnetic voltage of the Aurora-Wave</i>

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:04.160
<i>is approximately the same
as last year and due to this,</i>

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:06.790
<i>it was decided that revising the law
on altitude limitations</i>

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:09.190
<i>will be put off again
until next year.</i>

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:11.160
<i>Next up is today's weather.</i>

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:12.770
<i>Clear weather is expected for today.</i>

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:16.200
<i>It should be a pleasant day
without any strong winds.</i>

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:20.470
<i>However, isolated areas may be
strongly affected by the Aurora-Wave...</i>

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:44.100
<i>From the RUC to you!</i>

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:47.130
<i>A new resemble arm model!</i>

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:49.230
<i>The RZ-88!</i>

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:51.440
<i>An unprecedented level
of high performance</i>

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:53.910
<i>and advance functions
available for a low price!</i>

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:57.670
<i>For consultation regarding resemble
technology, come see us at the RUC!</i>

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:01.670
<i>From the RUC...</i>

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:07.950
<i>Welcome to Maverick Hunters Office!</i>

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:11.120
<i>I am the president,
Miranda Maverick.</i>

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:13.830
<i>You can count on us
to do any kind of job.</i>

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:16.530
<i>From finding lost cats
to arresting criminals,</i>

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:21.270
<i>our skilled hunters
will resolve your problems.</i>

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:23.930
<i>Please come pay us
a visit sometime.</i>

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:29.710
<i>So, do I really have to do
something like this, Kasha?</i>

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.540
<i>You are going to do it!</i>

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:33.810
<i>The TV station is coming here
to do a story on us</i>

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:36.320
<i>as a rapidly growing business.</i>

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:38.380
<i>What's the point if you
don't do some advertising?</i>

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:39.650
But still...

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:43.160
<i>Come on, one more time!</i>

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:46.290
<i>Maybe acting cute is too tough
for Mom, after all.</i>

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:48.890
<i>Next up, we're going to try
a different version!</i>

00:07:48.890 --> 00:07:50.260
What?

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:52.330
<i>Excuse me...</i>

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:55.300
<i>What about processing our cases?</i>

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:57.170
<i>Ready? Start!</i>

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:58.970
<i>Good grief.</i>

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:02.410
<i>Welcome to Maverick Hunters Office!</i>

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:03.740
<i>I am the president, Miranda...</i>

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:05.680
<i>What are you doing?</i>

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:07.710
<i>Oh, Roy.</i>

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:11.280
<i>Confirm for me that the order
to capture Dale Boyd has been fulfilled.</i>

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:13.950
<i>And while you're at it,
give me the usual supply of ammo.</i>

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:14.990
All right.

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:16.320
<i>I heard about this.</i>

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:18.920
<i>You apparently gave that guy
quite a beating yesterday.</i>

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:20.390
I didn't kill him.

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:24.330
<i>No, no, no!
That's not the issue here!</i>

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:26.700
<i>It's a matter of this office's image!</i>

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:31.540
<i>It hurts the image of this office
if our hunters are violent!</i>

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:34.010
<i>He's as crazy as ever.</i>

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:36.140
<i>I hear he's still looking
for his daughter,</i>

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:38.310
<i>even though it's already
been 12 years.</i>

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:40.250
<i>Do you get that?!</i>

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:41.880
<i>Roy.</i>

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:43.550
<i>Link up for me.</i>

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:44.480
Right.

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:52.620
<i>All right, it is confirmed that the order
to capture Dale Boyd has been fulfilled.</i>

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:55.260
<i>And once more
for the additional ammo.</i>

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:58.430
<i>Okay. Thank you
for your hard work.</i>

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.000
<i>Be careful, okay?</i>

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.760
<i>If something were to happen to you,
I could never make it up to Sarah.</i>

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:07.060
<i>Roy.</i>

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:13.680
<i>I haven't seen a transfer
for this month's rent yet, you know.</i>

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:17.380
<i>Take it out of my
commission like always.</i>

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:21.620
<i>I swear! He may be your old
best friend's husband,</i>

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:23.660
<i>but you go way too
easy on him, Mom!</i>

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:26.360
But...

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:28.260
<i>It can't be helped, you know?</i>

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:33.700
<i>Do you like those shoes?</i>

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:36.240
<i>Yeah! Thank you, Dad!</i>

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:37.260
<i>Sure thing.</i>

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:58.690
<i>As a result of the investigation
into the cause of this incident,</i>

00:09:58.690 --> 00:10:00.460
<i>it has been ascertained</i>

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:03.360
<i>that the magnetic voltage
of the Aurora-Wave has hit unusual levels.</i>

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:07.670
<i>The law on altitude limitations
will be revised, so that in the future...</i>

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:11.470
<i>Rita isn't dead...</i>

00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:13.340
<i>Rita isn't dead.</i>

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:19.840
<i>I'll find her, without fail.</i>

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:35.530
<i>I see.</i>

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:38.200
<i>Oh, yeah, what should we do
for dinner tonight?</i>

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:40.630
<i>Um... Meat!</i>

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:41.790
<i>- Meat?
- Yeah!</i>

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:03.790
<i>Thanks for all you did
for my partner Dale!</i>

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:04.980
<i>Die!</i>

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:30.520
<i>What is this, hide- and-seek?</i>

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:32.180
<i>You're in here, right?</i>

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:36.050
<i>I'm impressed that you made it
this far on that leg.</i>

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:37.760
<i>Let's get this over with</i>

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:40.420
<i>and put each other
out of our respective misery.</i>

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:45.420
<i>So long!</i>

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:49.900
<i>A resemble, just like
your partner, huh?</i>

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:51.370
<i>How boring.</i>

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:54.240
<i>Thanks to you,
my coat's in tatters.</i>

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:57.170
<i>Maybe I'll get a new one
with the bounty on your head.</i>

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:12.050
<i>You won't have to worry about that!</i>

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:16.150
<i>Too bad for you,
I'm not boring.</i>

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:22.370
<i>You're going to die now.</i>

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:25.170
<i>You won't be needing
a coat anymore.</i>

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:27.160
<i>This time, it's "so long" for real!</i>

00:12:29.110 --> 00:12:30.170
Wha-?!

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:34.000
<i>Who the hell is she?!
M-My arm!</i>

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:36.940
Damn it all!

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:42.790
<i>Looks like you saved me.</i>

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:44.760
<i>Are you a resemble?</i>

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:42.510
<i>So you're up.</i>

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:44.000
<i>What's the matter?</i>

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:50.080
<i>Hey! What's wrong?!</i>

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:02.330
<i>Are you feeling more steady now?</i>

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:04.670
<i>You're in some kind of fix, right?</i>

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:07.040
<i>I haven't contacted the police.</i>

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:09.810
<i>You saved me yesterday, after all.</i>

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:15.080
<i>What were you doing there?
And dressed like that...</i>

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.750
<i>What's your name?</i>

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:20.750
<i>Where are you from?</i>

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:24.490
<i>Can't you talk?</i>

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:29.460
<i>N-No, I can talk.</i>

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:31.260
<i>I've got work.</i>

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.800
<i>You can have those clothes.</i>

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:35.330
<i>Once you finish drinking that, go home.</i>

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:38.560
<i>The door locks automatically.
Don't have to worry about locking up.</i>

00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:46.810
<i>If you want Dale Boyd's partner,
you're looking for Grey Walker.</i>

00:14:46.810 --> 00:14:50.780
<i>He's just a small-time thug
with two resemble arms.</i>

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.720
<i>They're a vindictive pair.</i>

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:55.490
<i>He's bound to come after you again.</i>

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:57.060
<i>Do you know where I can find him?</i>

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:59.520
<i>Nah, I doubt he has a fixed hideout.</i>

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.430
<i>He'll be continually on the move.</i>

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:03.560
<i>I see.</i>

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:04.630
<i>You!</i>

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:07.000
<i>Why are you here?!</i>

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:08.970
<i>She an acquaintance of yours?</i>

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:11.760
<i>Don't ask.</i>

00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:31.320
<i>Don't follow me!</i>

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:03.450
Wha-?!

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:14.300
<i>Here we are, everyone.</i>

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:16.330
<i>This is the memorial
monument for Blast Fall,</i>

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:19.040
<i>which occurred 12 years ago.</i>

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:22.140
<i>I'm sure you're all
familiar with Blast Fall.</i>

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:26.340
<i>- Why are you following me?
- Approximately 80,000 died
and 40,000 went missing...</i>

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.320
<i>Hurry up and go home.</i>

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:32.310
<i>You gotta at least
have a home to go back to.</i>

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:39.220
<i>I'm going.
Don't follow me anymore.</i>

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:41.160
<i>Bye, now.</i>

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:42.350
<i>Don't!</i>

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:08.080
<i>Hey now, you're still on duty, man.</i>

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:11.990
<i>Sorry for the wait, partner.</i>

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:41.750
<i>Hey.</i>

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.620
<i>Why do you keep
hanging around me?</i>

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:46.190
<i>You must at least have family.</i>

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.950
<i>Hurry up and go home.</i>

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:55.430
<i>I do not know.
I do not know anything.</i>

00:17:55.430 --> 00:17:59.040
<i>Sorry, I'm not some
softhearted sap.</i>

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:03.740
<i>You saved me yesterday, so I let you
stay the night. That's all.</i>

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:05.540
<i>Go hit up someone else.</i>

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:10.280
<i>E-Excuse me,
do you have family?</i>

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:13.620
And what if I did?!

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:15.350
<i>It's none of your business.</i>

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:22.960
<i>Found you, Roy Revant!</i>

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:27.770
<i>Oh, thank you very much.</i>

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:31.070
<i>You idiot!
Hurry up and run!</i>

00:18:34.310 --> 00:18:36.640
<i>We went to a lot of trouble
to nab this guy</i>

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:38.380
<i>from the RUC's
Security Department.</i>

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:40.040
<i>You gotta let us
have more fun with it!</i>

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:42.070
<i>Come on, run! Run!</i>

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:46.050
<i>What is it this time?
A game of tag?</i>

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:48.310
<i>Looks like we'll get
some fun out of this.</i>

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:59.200
<i>It should be rough for him
with yesterday's wound.</i>

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.600
<i>Then shall we wrap this up?</i>

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:02.760
<i>Die!</i>

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:08.110
<i>Why didn't you run?!</i>

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:10.180
<i>You saved me.</i>

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:15.410
<i>Your leg is injured,
and yet you saved me.</i>

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:18.820
<i>This time, it is
my turn to save you.</i>

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:20.120
<i>You...</i>

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:23.150
<i>Hey, you brat! What do you
think you're doing?!</i>

00:19:23.150 --> 00:19:25.820
<i>He is injured, you know.
Please stop this!</i>

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:28.950
<i>The hell?!
You wanna die with him?!</i>

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:37.240
<i>What's up with that brat?!
Is she a full-body resemble?!</i>

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:39.070
<i>I-Impossible!</i>

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:42.200
<i>A resemble with that kind
of armoring is impossible!</i>

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:46.140
Wh-What?!

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:49.970
<i>Hey...</i>

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:05.060
<i>I do not know.</i>

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:08.100
<i>I do not know anything.</i>

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:11.130
<i>Not even who I am.</i>

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:16.440
<i>How dare you mess with us?!</i>

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.670
Why?

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:20.410
<i>Die!</i>

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:25.010
<i>Why can I do these things?!</i>

00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:40.660
<i>I hate bad people!</i>

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:45.930
<i>C-Crap! We'll hit the altitude
limit at this rate!</i>

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:57.920
<i>A bolt of lightning
from the Aurora Shell...</i>

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:59.470
<i>The altitude limit, huh?</i>

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:07.480
<i>Looks like you saved me again.</i>

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:14.670
<i>You were asking
about my family, right?</i>

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:17.970
<i>I had a wife, though she
died of an illness.</i>

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:21.740
<i>Her health was always
delicate to begin with.</i>

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:25.980
<i>I have a daughter.
Her name is Rita. She's my family.</i>

00:21:25.980 --> 00:21:27.580
<i>Bye, now.</i>

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:30.110
<i>Sorry, but I don't have time for you.</i>

00:21:30.110 --> 00:21:31.550
<i>Don't follow me.</i>

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:58.840
<i>On a clear day in the park</i>

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:01.780
<i>Looking up at the sky</i>

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:13.020
<i>There was a tiny little cloud
that almost vanished</i>

00:22:13.020 --> 00:22:17.790
<i>Letting the wind
take us where it will</i>

00:22:17.790 --> 00:22:20.730
<i>We live freely</i>

00:22:20.730 --> 00:22:28.770
<i>We make our way,
walking a little at a time</i>

00:22:28.770 --> 00:22:33.540
<i>We're the same</i>

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:38.310
<i>This precious time</i>

00:22:38.310 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>Each time we meet</i>

00:22:42.150 --> 00:22:51.690
<i>This feeling of not being alone
turns into kindness</i>

00:22:51.690 --> 00:22:58.030
<i>I can turn it into the courage
to believe in someone</i>

00:22:58.030 --> 00:23:10.470
<i>And surely, before I vanish
into the far reaches of that sky...</i>

00:23:17.050 --> 00:23:20.060
<i>Where did I come from?</i>

00:23:20.060 --> 00:23:22.590
<i>Just what am I...</i>

00:23:22.590 --> 00:23:24.990
<i>Next time, "A New Morning".</i>

00:23:24.990 --> 00:23:27.490
<i>May I have a fateful encounter with you?</i>
